@base = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1
@walletId = SUBSTITUA_PELO_ID_RETORNADO

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Abertura
POST {{base}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerId":"{{playerId}}","initialBalance":{"amount":"100.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### Aposta (repetir esta requisição testa idempotência)
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:bet-1

{"providerId":"provider-a","externalTransactionId":"bet-1","playerId":"{{playerId}}","walletId":"{{walletId}}","roundId":"round-1","gameId":"game-1","kind":"BET","money":{"amount":"25.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### Reembolso
POST {{base}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-a:refund-1

{"providerId":"provider-a","externalTransactionId":"refund-1","playerId":"{{playerId}}","walletId":"{{walletId}}","roundId":"round-1","gameId":"game-1","kind":"REFUND","money":{"amount":"25.00","currency":"BRL"},"referenceExternalTransactionId":"bet-1"}

### Consulta externa
GET {{base}}/providers/provider-a/wagering/transactions/bet-1

### Carteira
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}

### Ledger
GET {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliação
POST {{base}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation

### Métricas
GET {{base}}/metrics
